---
// HeroDBCA.astro - Componente central con Croquis Experimental DBCA
---

<section id="croquis-dbca" class="relative pt-8 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <!-- Technical Grid Header -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-tinta/20 pb-4 mb-8">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-tinta/80">
      <span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-musgo"></span>
      <span class="font-bold text-tinta">CROQUIS TÉCNICO // ESTACIÓN EXPERIMENTAL</span>
      <span class="text-tinta/40">|</span>
      <span>DISEÑO EN 4 PARCELAS MODULARES (T1-T4)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-tinta/70 flex items-center gap-4">
      <span>ESTADO: <strong class="text-tinta">TALLER EN EJECUCIÓN</strong></span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-niebla border border-tinta/30 text-[11px]">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-musgo"></span>
        CUPOS COMPLETOS
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Main Heading -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start mb-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-niebla border border-tinta text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="text-trigo font-bold">★</span>
        <span>METODOLOGÍA AGRO-COMPUTACIONAL // USFX - IASA</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-fraunces text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-tinta font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight">
        Diseño Experimental de Flujos de Trabajo <span class="italic font-normal text-musgo">con IA</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-tinta/85 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        Estructura tus investigaciones, síntesis bibliográficas y protocolos de campo bajo la lógica del 
        <strong class="text-tinta font-semibold">Diseño de Bloques Completos al Azar (DBCA)</strong>: 4 parcelas técnicas para dominar NotebookLM, Gems especializados y automatización en Docs.
      </p>

      <!-- Action buttons & Coordinates -->
      <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a 
          href="#modulo-fundamentos" 
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-musgo text-papel font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase border-2 border-tinta shadow-field hover:shadow-field-hover hover:bg-tierra transition-all"
        >
          EXPLORAR TRATAMIENTOS (T1–T4) →
        </a>
        <a 
          href="#facilitador" 
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-niebla text-tinta font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase border-2 border-tinta shadow-field hover:bg-papel transition-all"
        >
          SOBRE EL FACILITADOR
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Field notes metadata box -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-niebla/60 border-l-4 border-musgo font-mono text-xs space-y-1.5 text-tinta/80">
        <div class="font-bold text-tinta flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>// NOTA DE CAMPO:</span>
          <span class="text-trigo font-bold">NIVEL PRÁCTICO</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-tinta/70">
          Haz clic o sitúa el cursor sobre cualquier parcela del croquis a la derecha para inspeccionar los objetivos, tratamientos y prompts de cada módulo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SIGNATURE ELEMENT: Interactive DBCA Plot Grid Component -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6">
      <div class="border-2 border-tinta bg-niebla p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-field-lg relative">
        
        <!-- Croquis Coordinate Rulers -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-tinta/60 border-b border-tinta/20 pb-2 mb-4">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-tinta">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-musgo" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l4.553 2.276A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7" />
            </svg>
            PLANO DEL ENSAYO [GRID 2×2]
          </span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span>EJE X: [0m — 20m]</span>
            <span>EJE Y: [0m — 20m]</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Field Plots (T1 - T4) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 relative">
          
          <!-- Treatment 1: Fundamentos -->
          <a 
            href="#modulo-fundamentos" 
            class="group block p-4 bg-papel border-2 border-tinta hover:border-musgo hover:shadow-field transition-all relative overflow-hidden animate-plot-1"
          >
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-musgo text-papel font-mono text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 border-b border-l border-tinta group-hover:bg-trigo group-hover:text-tierra transition-colors">
              COORD [01,A]
            </div>
            
            <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-musgo font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">
              TRATAMIENTO T1
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-fraunces text-xl font-bold text-tinta group-hover:text-musgo transition-colors leading-tight mb-2">
              Fundamentos de IA
            </h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-tinta/80 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Arquitectura de contexto, control de alucinaciones y calibración de prompts agronómicos.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-tinta/10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px]">
              <span class="text-tinta/60">3 MÓDULOS</span>
              <span class="text-musgo font-bold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">VER PARCELA →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <!-- Treatment 2: NotebookLM -->
          <a 
            href="#modulo-notebooklm" 
            class="group block p-4 bg-papel border-2 border-tinta hover:border-musgo hover:shadow-field transition-all relative overflow-hidden animate-plot-2"
          >
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-musgo text-papel font-mono text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 border-b border-l border-tinta group-hover:bg-trigo group-hover:text-tierra transition-colors">
              COORD [01,B]
            </div>
            
            <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-musgo font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">
              TRATAMIENTO T2
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-fraunces text-xl font-bold text-tinta group-hover:text-musgo transition-colors leading-tight mb-2">
              NotebookLM de Campo
            </h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-tinta/80 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Cuaderno inteligente conectado a literatura técnica, fichas de variedades y datos experimentales.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-tinta/10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px]">
              <span class="text-tinta/60">2 PROTOCOLOS</span>
              <span class="text-musgo font-bold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">VER PARCELA →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <!-- Treatment 3: Gemini & Gems -->
          <a 
            href="#modulo-gemini-gems" 
            class="group block p-4 bg-papel border-2 border-tinta hover:border-musgo hover:shadow-field transition-all relative overflow-hidden animate-plot-3"
          >
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-musgo text-papel font-mono text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 border-b border-l border-tinta group-hover:bg-trigo group-hover:text-tierra transition-colors">
              COORD [02,A]
            </div>
            
            <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-musgo font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">
              TRATAMIENTO T3
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-fraunces text-xl font-bold text-tinta group-hover:text-musgo transition-colors leading-tight mb-2">
              Gems Especializados
            </h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-tinta/80 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Creación de asistentes para muestreo de plagas, fertilización foliar y sanidad vegetal.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-tinta/10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px]">
              <span class="text-tinta/60">4 ASISTENTES</span>
              <span class="text-musgo font-bold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">VER PARCELA →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <!-- Treatment 4: Docs & Casos Prácticos -->
          <a 
            href="#modulo-docs-casos" 
            class="group block p-4 bg-papel border-2 border-tinta hover:border-musgo hover:shadow-field transition-all relative overflow-hidden animate-plot-4"
          >
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-musgo text-papel font-mono text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 border-b border-l border-tinta group-hover:bg-trigo group-hover:text-tierra transition-colors">
              COORD [02,B]
            </div>
            
            <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-musgo font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">
              TRATAMIENTO T4
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-fraunces text-xl font-bold text-tinta group-hover:text-musgo transition-colors leading-tight mb-2">
              Docs & Informes Técnicos
            </h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-tinta/80 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Flujo integrado de generación de reportes técnicos, análisis ANOVA y entrega de resultados.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-tinta/10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px]">
              <span class="text-tinta/60">1 REPORTE FINAL</span>
              <span class="text-musgo font-bold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">VER PARCELA →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>

        <!-- Technical Field Legend -->
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-tinta/20 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] text-tinta/70">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-musgo inline-block"></span> Bloque I (Teoría)</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-trigo inline-block"></span> Bloque II (Aplicación)</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-tinta/50">ESCALA 1:1 // DATOS REALES</span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
